            <title>[KYLIN-5978] Reorder the native engine jar loader</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-5978</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Reorder the native engine jar loader and add default configuration for the engine&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Currently, Kylin&apos;s integration with the Native Engine involves approximately 140+ configuration items, some of which are mandatory and others are tuning parameters. We need to compile a basic configuration set with default parameters to reduce deployment costs.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
